{"3834940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tree Party!", "steam_appid": 3834940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 1vs1 action mini-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who plays the logging role should cut down trees, and the player who plays the forest growing role should just keep growing trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who takes the role of a logger must cut down trees and the player who takes the role of a tree grower must nurture trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the remaining time is less than 180 seconds, the kicking power increases! Kicked trees jump around the fence and go on a rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is up, or the logger cuts down the biggest tree at the far end of the fence, the winner is decided by the number of points at that point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the logger starts aiming for the big tree, the forestry player immediately activates the robot that is his friend and reassuring! It will protect the tree from the logger for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of points is increased or decreased by the number of trees cut down and the number of trees grown, respectively, so the logger must carefully judge when to cut the big tree!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 1vs1 action mini-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who plays the logging role should cut down trees, and the player who plays the forest growing role should just keep growing trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who takes the role of a logger must cut down trees and the player who takes the role of a tree grower must nurture trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the remaining time is less than 180 seconds, the kickin